Package: chess-vision-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/chess-vision-rs
Description: Recognise a chess position from an image and print FEN, Lichess links or a rendered board
 chess-vision detects the board and pieces in a screenshot or photo with a
 YOLOv8m model on ONNX Runtime, works out the orientation (reading the board's
 coordinate labels with PaddleOCR when present) and prints the FEN, Lichess
 analysis links or a rendered board. Models are downloaded to the XDG cache on
 first use.
